{"metadata":{"modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"title":"SelectInputComponentTokens Implementations","roleHeading":"API Collection","role":"collectionGroup"},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSelectInputComponentTokensProvider"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeselectinputcomponenttokensprovider\/selectinputcomponenttokens-implementations"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"topicSections":[{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSelectInputComponentTokensProvider\/sizeMinWidth"],"generated":true,"anchor":"Instance-Properties"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSelectInputComponentTokensProvider\/SelectInputComponentTokens-Implementations","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"article","references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeSelectInputComponentTokensProvider/sizeMinWidth":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeselectinputcomponenttokensprovider\/sizeminwidth","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Has for value token dimensions._8xlarge (= 96)"}],"type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"sizeMinWidth"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSTokensSemantic04SizeB5Tokena","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"SizeSemanticToken"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeSelectInputComponentTokensProvider\/sizeMinWidth","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","title":"sizeMinWidth"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeSelectInputComponentTokensProvider":{"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemeselec